  "Čistý 3-sviečkový Fair Value Gap na 30-minútovom grafe v kill zone.": "A clean 3-candle Fair Value Gap on the 30-minute chart in the kill zone.",
  "Validácia Trident Patternu": "Trident Pattern validation",
  "Doji sviečka hneď po FVG, wick do 50 % FVG (consequent encroachment).": "Doji candle right after the FVG, wick into 50% FVG (consequent encroachment).",
  "Wick ukázal absorpciu agresie predchádzajúcej strany – vysoká pravdepodobnosť reakcie.": "The wick showed absorption of prior-side aggression – high probability reaction area.",
  "Ďalšia sviečka zatvorila nad low doji – Trident pattern potvrdený (long).": "The next candle closed above the doji low – Trident pattern confirmed (long).",
  "Vstup, stop a riziko": "Entry, stop, and risk",
